{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-tilal-binghatti","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"tilal-binghatti-dunes-villas-academic-city","about":"Tilal Binghatti Dunes Villas is an exclusive residential development located in Academic City, Dubai. As part of Binghatti's first-ever villa community, the project offers 4-bedroom villas designed to deliver the perfect balance of luxury and privacy.With a starting price of AED 4.2M, the development presents an accessible entry into a high-potential investment, supported by strong capital appreciation driven by its strategic location and premium amenities. The villas offer a quieter residential setting focused on greenery, family-friendly outdoor living, and wellness. Residents enjoy direct access to the wider community, including Pearl Beach, the Alwaha swimmable lakes, and the Aira Realm Central Park with its 1.6 km cycling and jogging track.Tilal Binghatti Dunes Villas by Binghatti Developers feature expansive floor plans, double-height living areas, resort-scale private pools, and superior quality finishes. With a Retail Boulevard, Clubhouse, wellness zones, nursery, clinics, mosque, and over 50 amenities in total, the community delivers a lifestyle of  convenience and long-term value.","price":4200000,"title":"Tilal Binghatti Dunes Villas","bitrix":{"id":1500,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Tilal Binghatti Dunes Villas","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Binghatti","project_location":"Tilal Binghatti"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Feature_a755ca767f.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Feature_a755ca767f.webp"}],"status":null,"_geoloc":{"lat":25.122301779414,"lng":55.433941788879},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gallery_15_2290916d0e.webp","464x312":"http